      "so_that": "the spouse exemption from source tax can be decided, as for Tomás, without collecting spouse data that no party needs",
      "priority": "P1",
      "priority_reason": "The spouse exemption changes who has to do source tax at all; without it a married employee such as Tomás would wrongly be treated as subject (F-hr_transcript-b90bd9).",
